WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
The generated candidate enters
a controlled acceptance path.

00:00:03.547 --> 00:00:06.400
Approved intent defines
the expected behavior,

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:10.880
AI proposes a test, and a human reviews
the assertions before execution.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:15.041
Independent checks challenge both
the correct build and a known fault.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.600
A failed requirement sends the candidate
back for rework and leaves the maintained

00:00:19.653 --> 00:00:24.400
suite unchanged. Only accepted evidence
and review can promote the change.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.440
The diagram makes that
rejection path explicit.
